ALBUKHR Pi dApp Launch Service — Internal/External Project Eligibility
Matsayi: Daftarin aiwatarwa ne kawai. Ba a gyara GitHub, Supabase, Storage, production ko deployment ba.
1. Iyakar aikin da aka tabbatar
Sabon zaɓin User Side:
pi_studio — Pi Studio Assistance (ya ci gaba kamar yadda yake).
developer — Developer-built dApp (ya ci gaba kamar yadda yake).
albukhr_project — Build an App for My ALBUKHR Project (sabon zaɓi; Internal da External kawai).
Core projects ba sa cikin sabon zaɓin, ba a nuna su a API response ba, kuma POST endpoint dole ne ya ƙi duk Core project ID ko da an aika da shi da hannu.
